---
layout: self-referral
landing: true
title: Learn about our self-referral pilots
intro: The pilot enables eligible patients with symptoms to self-refer directly into specialist breast diagnostic services. It gives patients a faster, more direct way to access specialist care, without needing to see a GP first.
sections:

# Landing page: cards
  - heading: Onboarding your service
    href: /111online/breast-self-referral/onboarding
    description: Information to help you get started, including an onboarding pack and readiness checklist.
    
  
  - heading: Watch a demo
    href: /111online/breast-self-referral/demo
    description: See the digital journey users take from 111 online to specialist clinics.

  - heading: Case studies
    href: /111online/breast-self-referral/case-studies
    description: Read about our current pilot sites and supporting data.

  - heading: FAQs
    href: /111online/breast-self-referral/faqs
    description: Find answers to common questions about the self-referral into breast diagnostic clinics pilot.

# Landing page: case studies from live sites    
  - heading: Somerset
    content: <p>Somerset NHS Foundation Trust was the first in England to join the self-referral pilot.</p>
    resource:
      image: /images/self-referral-trust-tile-Somerset.webp
      link:
        text: View case studies
        href: /111online/breast-self-referral/case-studies#somerset

  - heading: "Cambridge"
    content: <p>Cambridge University Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust was the second site to join the pilot and promote the new self-referral route.</p>
    resource:
      image: /images/self-referral-trust-tile-Cambridge.webp
      link:
        text: View case studies
        href: /111online/breast-self-referral/case-studies#cambridge


  # Landing page: pilot sites
  - heading: Somerset NHS Foundation Trust
    sites:
      - Musgrove
      - Yeovil

  - heading: Cambridge University Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust
    sites:
      - Addenbrooke's

  - heading: North West Anglia NHS Foundation Trust
    sites:
      - Peterborough

  - heading: Maidstone and Tunbridge Wells NHS Trust
    sites:
      - Maidstone
      - Tunbridge Wells

  - heading: Manchester University Foundation Trust
    sites:
      - North Manchester
      - Wythenshawe


  
---

{% from 'button/macro.njk' import button %}
{% from 'card/macro.njk' import card %}

<section class="nhsuk-section">
    <ul class="nhsuk-grid-row nhsuk-card-group">
        {% for section in sections.slice(0, 4) %}
        <li class="nhsuk-grid-column-one-half nhsuk-card-group__item">
            {{ card({
                "href": section.href | url,
                "clickable": "true",
                "heading": section.heading,
                "headingClasses": "nhsuk-heading-m",
                "description": section.description,
                "variant": "primary"
            }) }}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>

<hr class="nhsuk-section-break nhsuk-section-break--xl nhsuk-section-break--visible">

<section class="nhsuk-section">

    <h1 class="nhsuk-heading-xl nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-5">How does it work?</h1>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">View the live self-referral pathway from 111 online.</p>

    <div style="padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;"><iframe
            src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1230394686?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479"
            title=0 frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media;" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;" title="."></iframe></div>
    <script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script>

</section>

<hr class="nhsuk-section-break nhsuk-section-break--xl nhsuk-section-break--visible">

<section class="nhsuk-section">

    <h1 class="nhsuk-heading-xl nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-5">Case studies from live sites</h1>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">Find out more about how trusts nationwide have introduced the pilot for their patients.</p>

    {% for section in sections.slice(4, 6) -%}
    {% if loop.first == false %}
    <hr class="nhsuk-section-break nhsuk-section-break--l nhsuk-section-break--visible nhsuk-u-margin-top-0">
    {% endif %}

    <div class="nhsuk-grid-row">
        <div class="nhsuk-grid-column-one-half nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-6">
            <img src="{{ section.resource.image | url }}" alt="">
        </div>
        <div class="nhsuk-grid-column-one-half">
            <h2>{{ section.heading }}</h2>

            {{- section.content | safe -}}

            {{- button({
                "href": section.resource.link.href | url,
                "text": section.resource.link.text,
                "classes": "nhsuk-button--secondary"
            }) -}}
        </div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor -%}

    <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-1">Pilot sites</h2>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">The following sites are piloting self-referrals for breast diagnostics clinics.</p>

    <ul class="nhsuk-grid-row nhsuk-card-group">
        {% for section in sections.slice(6) %}
            {% set siteList %}
                <ul class="nhsuk-list nhsuk-list--bullet">
                    {% for site in section.sites %}<li>{{ site }}</li>{% endfor %}
                </ul>
            {% endset %}
            <li class="nhsuk-grid-column-one-half nhsuk-card-group__item">
                {{ card({
                    clickable: false,
                    "heading": section.heading,
                    "headingClasses": "nhsuk-heading-s",
                    "descriptionHtml": siteList,
                    "variant": "secondary"
                }) }}
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>

</section>
